00:01:23.160 --> 00:01:27.070
<i>For three generations, Silver's family
has been fighting against Akakabuto.</i>

00:01:27.200 --> 00:01:33.120
<i>Silver has trained hard to
defeat his fathers murderer, Akakabuto.</i>

00:01:34.040 --> 00:01:38.910
<i>One day he meets a mysterious pack
of wild dogs in the mountains.</i>

00:01:39.080 --> 00:01:44.110
<i>It was the dogs who wanted
to defeat Akakabuto.</i>

00:01:48.890 --> 00:01:54.960
<i>Their leader resembled Silver's
father, Riki, who he thought was dead.</i>

00:01:55.170 --> 00:01:57.970
<i>Silver didn't believe his eyes-</i>

00:01:58.090 --> 00:02:01.180
<i>- but lacked the ability
to find out the truth.</i>

00:02:02.170 --> 00:02:05.930
<i>Silver is approved as a capable
male by the platoon commander, Ben, and-</i>

00:02:05.980 --> 00:02:09.350
<i>- says farewell to his friend
Daisuke and his mother Fuji-</i>

00:02:09.350 --> 00:02:14.610
<i>- and take off with his new friends to find
dogs that can fight against Akakabuto.</i>

00:02:14.770 --> 00:02:22.490
<i>To Silver, the trip also
meant to be a magnificent male.</i>

00:02:25.290 --> 00:02:33.170
DEMONS!
THE THREE BROTHERS FROM KAI

00:03:06.670 --> 00:03:07.950
Okay!

00:03:14.250 --> 00:03:15.500
Hey!

00:03:17.190 --> 00:03:21.590
Don't jump around!
Stay in the group!

00:03:25.310 --> 00:03:29.140
There are those who have slipped
down in thorn shrubs and died!

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:33.600
Don't jump on unknown land.
That's the iron rule!

00:03:33.650 --> 00:03:34.980
Thanks, Cross!

00:03:35.750 --> 00:03:38.570
Why are you slacking off?!

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:42.030
That kid slows us down.

00:03:42.480 --> 00:03:47.710
Hyena! If you complain about Ben's
decision, you can go home to Sniper!

00:03:47.840 --> 00:03:51.870
I didn't mean to accuse, Great!

00:03:51.910 --> 00:03:53.500
Keep quiet then, and run!

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:25.110
<i>Under Ben's command-</i>

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:31.870
<i>-the first platoon ran day and night south
and came into Kai, in Yamanashi.</i>

00:04:36.490 --> 00:04:40.690
Ben, we will break down if we
continue to run like this.

00:04:40.850 --> 00:04:43.800
I know! We will rest under that
cliff shadow, over there.

00:05:01.260 --> 00:05:02.690
Silver!

00:05:03.260 --> 00:05:06.110
Go hunt us some food.

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:11.450
Are you so tired that
you can't stand up?

00:05:11.490 --> 00:05:16.420
Ben, let him rest a little.
He's been running for ten days.

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:21.250
It's the newcomers job to get food.
No exceptions.

00:05:21.540 --> 00:05:25.380
Don't worry, Cross.  I can run.

00:05:25.740 --> 00:05:27.690
I'll help.

00:05:27.690 --> 00:05:28.510
Cross!

00:05:29.510 --> 00:05:33.850
Not doing it for Silver.
We're all hungry here.

00:05:35.110 --> 00:05:36.270
Cross!

00:06:01.210 --> 00:06:03.170
<i>What a jump!</i>

00:06:04.210 --> 00:06:06.340
<i>Silver's leg strength is the real thing!</i>

00:06:07.440 --> 00:06:10.390
It has been a long time since I
got something this good!

00:06:10.520 --> 00:06:13.560
The ones who slack off,
eat the most!

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:17.810
Good! We will leave as soon
as you have stuffed your bellies.

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:23.320
Ben! Aren't we looking
for capable males?

00:06:23.480 --> 00:06:26.820
That's right, and why you ask, Hyena?

00:06:26.820 --> 00:06:30.860
Why do we run into the mountains
where there is no one to be found?

00:06:31.280 --> 00:06:34.320
I don't have to explain that to you.

00:06:34.440 --> 00:06:37.330
If you do not explain,
I will go to town.

00:06:40.010 --> 00:06:42.580
Right, I also want to know.

00:06:42.580 --> 00:06:43.920
You have to let us know.

00:06:45.920 --> 00:06:48.720
Ben, I trust you.

00:06:48.970 --> 00:06:52.800
But it doesn't hurt if you tell us.

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:55.850
I agree with that!

00:06:56.560 --> 00:06:58.960
Okay then. Follow!

00:07:21.220 --> 00:07:22.810
Look!

00:07:22.940 --> 00:07:24.150
A city!

00:07:24.150 --> 00:07:25.590
And so close!

00:07:26.580 --> 00:07:29.760
This is Kofu, in Yamanashi.

00:07:30.840 --> 00:07:34.940
Anyone can go down to town
and search for capable males here.

00:07:35.060 --> 00:07:37.640
I know cause I was born here.

00:07:37.800 --> 00:07:40.430
Why don't we go down, then?

00:07:41.300 --> 00:07:43.420
Because...

00:07:46.780 --> 00:07:47.730
Run!

00:08:05.790 --> 00:08:07.500
Everyone, watch out!

00:08:18.220 --> 00:08:19.720
Silver, run!

00:08:28.320 --> 00:08:29.270
Silver!

00:09:03.560 --> 00:09:05.730
What bloodthirsty dogs!

00:09:06.010 --> 00:09:09.020
They are called the Demon dogs.
The three brothers from Kai.

00:09:09.410 --> 00:09:11.780
Demon dogs?
The brothers from Kai?

00:09:15.170 --> 00:09:17.610
The one with red fur is called Akatora.

00:09:17.660 --> 00:09:21.370
The black one-eyed, is Kurotora.
and the one-eared, Chutora.

00:09:22.050 --> 00:09:24.750
This is the reason I brought us here.

00:09:24.970 --> 00:09:26.460
Who are they?

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:31.130
They were abandoned four years ago.

00:09:32.210 --> 00:09:35.050
The puppies were not
even a month old.

00:09:35.930 --> 00:09:41.260
A giant worm living in the area
thought they were an easy meal.

00:09:42.210 --> 00:09:48.690
But the puppies had kai-blood in their
veins, they fought without fear.

00:09:50.420 --> 00:09:55.860
They should have been devoured,
but they fought like one big creature-

00:09:55.980 --> 00:09:59.200
- and killed the snake, and ate it up.

00:10:00.260 --> 00:10:04.890
Since that day, the brothers have
worked together in battle against enemies.

00:10:05.020 --> 00:10:10.130
No beast has a chance against
their threefold attacks.

00:10:19.070 --> 00:10:23.700
For them, "to live" is
the same as "to fight".

00:10:29.390 --> 00:10:32.940
Who is it, that stands
and talks shit about us?

00:10:32.950 --> 00:10:35.150
Should we kill them as a dessert?

00:10:35.190 --> 00:10:40.200
They have intruded, and will die!

00:10:41.230 --> 00:10:42.370
Silver, beware!

00:10:45.660 --> 00:10:47.120
Why me?!

00:10:48.550 --> 00:10:51.500
Bastard! Don't think you can...

00:10:53.170 --> 00:10:54.590
Ben, what are you doing?

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:56.420
Let me take care of this.

00:10:56.800 --> 00:11:00.380
Are you trying to tame
those demonic dogs?

00:11:00.480 --> 00:11:06.430
Talking is probably not enough.
So there will be a fight with lives at stake.

00:11:06.770 --> 00:11:10.190
Do we really need
them that much?

00:11:11.880 --> 00:11:18.110
They are worth a hundred males.
It is worth risking your life for.

00:11:25.370 --> 00:11:29.400
I don't know who you
are, but I don't like-

00:11:29.520 --> 00:11:32.750
- when you intrude on our
territory and steal prey.

00:11:32.810 --> 00:11:35.000
We have not come to hunt for prey.

00:11:36.490 --> 00:11:40.720
What are you doing here
in the mountains, then?

00:11:41.330 --> 00:11:45.760
I want to recruit you

00:11:45.760 --> 00:11:47.850
What? To your pack?

00:11:48.350 --> 00:11:49.430
Are you kidding?!

00:11:49.730 --> 00:11:51.600
You can't be serious!

00:11:52.180 --> 00:11:53.980
I'm being serious.

00:12:23.660 --> 00:12:27.510
You don't seem to lie.
Come on, then!

00:12:27.580 --> 00:12:31.560
One at a time only takes time.
Come at us, all of you at once!

00:12:32.300 --> 00:12:35.730
No! I'll take care of this myself.

00:12:47.510 --> 00:12:50.410
This is bad! We have to do something.

00:12:50.410 --> 00:12:52.870
But he gave us an order.

00:12:57.630 --> 00:12:59.500
Three against one is cheating!

00:12:59.670 --> 00:13:00.880
Wait, Silver!

00:13:09.590 --> 00:13:11.310
Now we are three against three!

00:13:20.270 --> 00:13:22.530
Impressive for a pup.

00:13:22.860 --> 00:13:25.280
I'm not pup. My name is Silver!

00:13:25.400 --> 00:13:27.410
Silver, the bear killer!

00:13:27.450 --> 00:13:28.870
Get off your high horse kid!

00:13:36.210 --> 00:13:38.000
Damn flea!

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:42.300
Did you see, Smith?

00:13:42.720 --> 00:13:46.340
It seems like Kurotora isn't
following Silver's movements!

00:13:46.880 --> 00:13:49.260
<i>To think that one of them is so fast.</i>

00:13:49.960 --> 00:13:52.720
<i>Not good!
I won't defeat him if I just avoid him.</i>

00:13:52.760 --> 00:13:54.930
<i>I have to find an opening.</i>

00:14:16.170 --> 00:14:20.040
<i>One bite and he will crush my bones!</i>

00:14:20.170 --> 00:14:22.630
<i>How should I attack him?</i>

00:14:25.090 --> 00:14:26.630
What's the matter with you, Ben!

00:14:26.630 --> 00:14:30.510
Don't worry! He's waiting for
the enemy to get tired.

00:14:30.770 --> 00:14:33.430
That's one of the things that
make Ben strong.

00:14:35.940 --> 00:14:38.640
Ben! Hurry and take care of him!

00:14:38.940 --> 00:14:40.450
<i>Ben?</i>

00:14:40.660 --> 00:14:42.310
Cross! Focus!

00:15:00.740 --> 00:15:02.830
Your stubborn bastard!

00:15:13.670 --> 00:15:18.600
<i>You can't jump.
No one comes out of my grip.</i>

00:15:23.770 --> 00:15:24.560
Cross!

00:15:24.690 --> 00:15:25.820
Wait!!!

00:15:27.230 --> 00:15:29.900
It's an order! Don't interfere!

00:15:30.510 --> 00:15:32.990
But Cross is dying, Ben!

00:15:33.310 --> 00:15:35.370
<i>Ben... Ben?</i>

00:15:50.320 --> 00:15:54.590
You hear? Three against three!
Don't break that promise!

00:15:54.680 --> 00:15:56.100
But Cross!

00:15:56.390 --> 00:15:58.930
I know what I got into!

00:16:12.240 --> 00:16:13.700
Cross, are you okay?

00:16:14.180 --> 00:16:16.370
Don't interfere, Silver!

00:16:16.640 --> 00:16:18.620
Kid! Don't bother us!

00:16:18.740 --> 00:16:19.370
Hold up!

00:16:20.000 --> 00:16:24.440
Wait! Cross is a female!
If you want to fight, fight me!

00:16:25.630 --> 00:16:26.670
A bitch?

00:16:26.670 --> 00:16:29.340
Silver, that doesn't matter in battle.

00:16:29.490 --> 00:16:32.340
Did I just fight a female?

00:16:32.340 --> 00:16:33.630
Damn pup!

00:16:34.850 --> 00:16:36.220
Stop there!

00:16:37.210 --> 00:16:40.520
Where are you going?
It's me you are fighting!

00:16:40.850 --> 00:16:44.270
Bitch get off now, before you die.

00:16:44.290 --> 00:16:49.480
Just try, Demon dog from Kai.
Show me what you can do!

00:16:49.480 --> 00:16:51.820
That's what I really want!

00:16:52.280 --> 00:16:54.990
What are you really after?

00:16:59.450 --> 00:17:02.830
You are a bit weak
to be a pack leader.

00:17:03.140 --> 00:17:06.710
Don't underestimate me, Akatora.
Come at me!

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:09.710
<i>He knows my name...
I knew it!</i>

00:17:10.780 --> 00:17:12.210
Here I come, Akatora!

00:17:12.260 --> 00:17:13.340
Wait!

00:17:18.460 --> 00:17:20.390
<i>I'm sure...</i>

00:17:20.700 --> 00:17:23.890
Chutora, Kurotora, stop it!
We are done here!

00:17:24.460 --> 00:17:27.520
What are you howling about, Akatora?

00:17:27.700 --> 00:17:30.730
I will explain later.
Where is Kurotora?

00:17:31.260 --> 00:17:33.990
He followed the pup into the forest.

00:17:34.490 --> 00:17:36.030
Hurry and find them!

00:17:47.710 --> 00:17:53.800
Where did he go?
The little puppy probably ran away.

00:17:54.010 --> 00:17:55.470
Over here, Kurotora!

00:17:56.110 --> 00:17:58.720
You will see what a bear dog can do!

00:18:08.350 --> 00:18:10.230
They are not here! Where are they?

00:18:16.150 --> 00:18:17.280
Silver!

00:18:30.760 --> 00:18:33.190
<i>This was Silver's tactic.</i>

00:18:33.320 --> 00:18:39.640
<i>The training he had endured with
Grandpa Takeda became his weapon.</i>

00:18:48.640 --> 00:18:50.020
It stopped!

00:18:57.030 --> 00:18:58.150
Silver!

00:19:17.880 --> 00:19:19.380
Kurotora, wake up!

00:19:20.250 --> 00:19:21.590
Kurotora!

00:19:21.970 --> 00:19:25.220
No worries.
He just got some water in him.

00:19:34.020 --> 00:19:36.610
Kurotora, answer!

00:19:41.820 --> 00:19:43.700
Well done, Silver!

00:19:44.410 --> 00:19:47.120
Little bastard! We are not done yet!

00:19:47.500 --> 00:19:49.700
Stop, Kurotora!  It's enough now.

00:19:49.750 --> 00:19:50.830
What!?

00:19:51.180 --> 00:19:53.710
They are not our enemies.

00:19:53.750 --> 00:19:54.630
What do you mean?

00:19:55.170 --> 00:19:56.920
Haven't you noticed yet?

00:19:58.100 --> 00:20:01.510
It's Ben. The dog who
saved our lives a long time ago.

00:20:02.060 --> 00:20:03.300
Ben?

00:20:05.470 --> 00:20:10.020
That's right. Four years ago,
when we were abandoned in the mountains-

00:20:10.560 --> 00:20:15.150
- The killer dog Tin smelled us and attacked.

00:20:15.630 --> 00:20:19.820
You stayed in the box.
We tried to help you-

00:20:19.830 --> 00:20:21.990
- but we couldn't do anything.

00:20:22.200 --> 00:20:26.530
Just when he was going to kill
you in front of our eyes...

00:20:37.190 --> 00:20:41.010
Then... He is the dog that
saved my life.

00:20:43.320 --> 00:20:48.470
Not just your life. It is thanks
to Ben that we three live today.

00:20:48.640 --> 00:20:49.930
Sorry, Ben.

00:20:50.270 --> 00:20:53.020
My life is in your hands.

00:20:53.060 --> 00:20:55.980
No... I'm not going to
require any payback.

00:20:56.520 --> 00:21:00.190
I'll ask again. What are you
doing in these mountains?

00:21:01.120 --> 00:21:02.190
You see...

00:21:10.360 --> 00:21:14.960
We are looking for males who
can fight against Akakabuto.

00:21:15.160 --> 00:21:18.540
Then we would like to join you.

00:21:18.540 --> 00:21:20.920
Our lives are in your hands!

00:21:21.090 --> 00:21:24.220
Yes!
I'll gladly risk my life for my savior.

00:21:24.450 --> 00:21:28.720
Thanks! You three brothers
are worth a hundred males.

00:21:29.050 --> 00:21:33.490
<i>Ben is an amazing male.
A real male is not only strong -</i>

00:21:33.610 --> 00:21:36.020
<i>-but patience is a strength as well.</i>

00:21:36.490 --> 00:21:41.070
But before we join you, we want to
ask you to helps us with something.

00:21:41.110 --> 00:21:42.480
What is that, Akatora?

00:21:42.570 --> 00:21:45.400
We have a debt to
Moss from the Misty mountain.

00:21:45.730 --> 00:21:47.360
Moss from Misty mountain?

00:21:47.780 --> 00:21:50.990
It must be a good male,
if you owe him a favor.

00:21:51.080 --> 00:21:51.910
Yeah.

00:21:53.260 --> 00:21:57.870
All right.
I also want to see that male.

00:22:08.300 --> 00:22:11.930
Silver!
Well done on your first trip.

00:22:15.260 --> 00:22:20.150
<i>Then Ben, got three strong
allies, the brothers from Kai.</i>

00:22:20.820 --> 00:22:24.480
<i>But in the Misty mountain there is
a strong male named Moss.</i>

00:22:24.900 --> 00:22:28.320
<i>Silver and the others is heading there.</i>

00:22:37.110 --> 00:22:43.130
<i>Meanwhile, Hyena, Sniper's
servant, was making insidious plans.</i>

00:22:43.150 --> 00:22:45.050
<i>But Silver
didn't suspect anything.</i>
